      "difficulty": "简单",
      "type": "代码填空",
      "title": "两期均采购过的商品",
      "context": "使用课程中的小型订单明细、采购明细示例数据，完成“两期均采购过的商品”的查询练习。示例表中的金额以元为单位，不是企业库中以分为单位的整数金额。",
      "requirements": "补全代码中的一个空位，使完整SQL满足以下要求。可输入具有相同语义的片段，提交后按完整代码执行结果核对。\n从 order_items 与 purchase_items 中找出两边都出现的不重复 product_id。\n输出字段名称及顺序：product_id\n结果排序要求：按 product_id 升序排列。\n计算及格式要求：未指定小数位数时，保留原计算结果的精度；NULL、数字 0 和空字符串是三种不同的值。",
      "datasetId": "q0177-lesson",
      "schemaVersion": 3,
      "contentVersion": "3.0.0",
      "sourceTables": [
        "order_items",
        "purchase_items"
      ],
      "initialCode": "SELECT product_id FROM order_items {{blank1}} SELECT product_id FROM purchase_items ORDER BY product_id",
      "options": [],
      "acceptedBlanks": [
        {
          "id": "blank1",
          "referenceText": "INTERSECT",
          "acceptedForms": [
            "INTERSECT"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "expectedOutput": {
        "kind": "query",
        "columns": [
          "product_id"
        ],
        "rows": [
          [
            1
          ],
          [
            2
          ]
        ],
        "rowCount": 2
      },
      "referenceSolutions": [
        {
          "kind": "reference",
          "mysqlSql": "SELECT product_id FROM order_items INTERSECT SELECT product_id FROM purchase_items ORDER BY product_id",
          "sqliteSql": "SELECT product_id FROM order_items INTERSECT SELECT product_id FROM purchase_items ORDER BY product_id"
        },
        {
          "kind": "语法等价",
          "mysqlSql": "SELECT ALL product_id FROM order_items INTERSECT SELECT product_id FROM purchase_items ORDER BY product_id",
          "sqliteSql": "SELECT ALL product_id FROM order_items INTERSECT SELECT product_id FROM purchase_items ORDER BY product_id",
          "explanation": "普通 SELECT 默认保留重复记录，显式 ALL 不改变结果。"
        }
      ],
      "hints": [
        "要找出“两边都有”的商品，是集合的交集关系。",
        "集合运算符把上下两个查询的结果合并：UNION 并集，INTERSECT 交集，EXCEPT 差集。",
        "空位里是连接两个查询的集合运算符；最后的 ORDER BY 对合并后的结果排序。"
      ],
      "explanation": "INTERSECT 只保留两个查询结果里都出现的商品编号，并自动去重；ORDER BY 对合并后的结果排序。\n易错：用 EXCEPT 得到的是第一个查询里有、第二个查询里没有的商品，方向和含义都不同。",
      "commonErrors": [
        {
          "sql": "SELECT product_id FROM order_items EXCEPT SELECT product_id FROM purchase_items ORDER BY product_id",
          "reason": "共同集合与差集方向不同；这是明细集合匹配练习，不表示同一业务期间的真实采购销售关系。",
          "validation": "典型错误已在至少一组夹具被结果/状态比对拒绝"
        }
      ],
