      "difficulty": "中等",
      "type": "独立编写",
      "title": "企业两期客户覆盖规模",
      "context": "使用课程中的小型新客户名单、旧客户名单示例数据，完成“企业两期客户覆盖规模”的查询练习。示例表中的金额以元为单位，不是企业库中以分为单位的整数金额。",
      "requirements": "计算两个名单合并后，不重复且不为 NULL 的客户数 n。\n输出字段名称及顺序：n\n结果排序要求：不要求排序；判断时比较各行及其重复次数，不比较行的先后顺序。\n计算及格式要求：未指定小数位数时，保留原计算结果的精度；NULL、数字 0 和空字符串是三种不同的值。",
      "datasetId": "q0181-lesson",
      "schemaVersion": 3,
      "contentVersion": "3.0.0",
      "sourceTables": [
        "new_customers",
        "old_customers"
      ],
      "initialCode": "",
      "options": [],
      "acceptedBlanks": [],
      "expectedOutput": {
        "kind": "query",
        "columns": [
          "n"
        ],
        "rows": [
          [
            4
          ]
        ],
        "rowCount": 1
      },
      "referenceSolutions": [
        {
          "kind": "reference",
          "mysqlSql": "SELECT COUNT(customer_id) AS n FROM (SELECT customer_id FROM old_customers UNION SELECT customer_id FROM new_customers) AS u",
          "sqliteSql": "SELECT COUNT(customer_id) AS n FROM (SELECT customer_id FROM old_customers UNION SELECT customer_id FROM new_customers) AS u"
        },
        {
          "kind": "语法等价",
          "mysqlSql": "SELECT ALL COUNT(customer_id) AS n FROM (SELECT customer_id FROM old_customers UNION SELECT customer_id FROM new_customers) AS u",
          "sqliteSql": "SELECT ALL COUNT(customer_id) AS n FROM (SELECT customer_id FROM old_customers UNION SELECT customer_id FROM new_customers) AS u",
          "explanation": "普通 SELECT 默认保留重复记录，显式 ALL 不改变结果。"
        }
      ],
      "hints": [
        "先把两个名单合并并去重，再数有多少个客户。",
        "UNION 合并并去重，COUNT(列) 只数不为 NULL 的值。",
        "合并写在子查询里，外层再 COUNT。"
      ],
      "explanation": "UNION 先合并两个名单并去掉重复，COUNT(customer_id) 再统计其中不为 NULL 的客户数，每位客户只算一次。\n易错：用 UNION ALL 合并，在两个名单里都出现的客户会被数两次。",
      "commonErrors": [
        {
          "sql": "SELECT COUNT(customer_id) AS n FROM (SELECT customer_id FROM old_customers UNION ALL SELECT customer_id FROM new_customers) AS u",
          "reason": "先求集合并集再计数，重复客户只计一次；COUNT 忽略NULL。",
          "validation": "典型错误已在至少一组夹具被结果/状态比对拒绝"
        }
      ],
