      "difficulty": "中等",
      "type": "独立编写",
      "title": "标签区分两个名单来源",
      "context": "使用课程中的小型新客户名单、旧客户名单示例数据，完成“标签区分两个名单来源”的查询练习。示例表中的金额以元为单位，不是企业库中以分为单位的整数金额。",
      "requirements": "合并 old_customers 与 new_customers，输出 customer_id、source（取值为 old 或 new），保留各表内部的重复记录。\n输出字段名称及顺序：customer_id, source\n结果排序要求：按 customer_id 升序排列；customer_id 相同时，再按 source 升序排列。\n计算及格式要求：未指定小数位数时，保留原计算结果的精度；NULL、数字 0 和空字符串是三种不同的值。",
      "datasetId": "q0182-lesson",
      "schemaVersion": 3,
      "contentVersion": "3.0.0",
      "sourceTables": [
        "new_customers",
        "old_customers"
      ],
      "initialCode": "",
      "options": [],
      "acceptedBlanks": [],
      "expectedOutput": {
        "kind": "query",
        "columns": [
          "customer_id",
          "source"
        ],
        "rows": [
          [
            1,
            "old"
          ],
          [
            2,
            "new"
          ],
          [
            2,
            "old"
          ],
          [
            2,
            "old"
          ],
          [
            3,
            "new"
          ],
          [
            3,
            "old"
          ],
          [
            4,
            "new"
          ]
        ],
        "rowCount": 7
      },
      "referenceSolutions": [
        {
          "kind": "reference",
          "mysqlSql": "SELECT customer_id,'old' AS source FROM old_customers UNION ALL SELECT customer_id,'new' AS source FROM new_customers ORDER BY customer_id,source",
          "sqliteSql": "SELECT customer_id,'old' AS source FROM old_customers UNION ALL SELECT customer_id,'new' AS source FROM new_customers ORDER BY customer_id,source"
        },
        {
          "kind": "语法等价",
          "mysqlSql": "SELECT ALL customer_id,'old' AS source FROM old_customers UNION ALL SELECT customer_id,'new' AS source FROM new_customers ORDER BY customer_id,source",
          "sqliteSql": "SELECT ALL customer_id,'old' AS source FROM old_customers UNION ALL SELECT customer_id,'new' AS source FROM new_customers ORDER BY customer_id,source",
          "explanation": "普通 SELECT 默认保留重复记录，显式 ALL 不改变结果。"
        }
      ],
      "hints": [
        "要在合并时给每一行标上来源。",
        "在每个查询里加一列常量（如 'old'），合并后就能区分来源。",
        "要保留各表内部的重复记录，合并方式要选不去重的那种。"
      ],
      "explanation": "两个查询各加一列常量来源 'old' 和 'new'，再用 UNION ALL 叠加，保留各自内部的重复记录；ORDER BY 让顺序固定。\n易错：用 UNION 会把完全相同的行去掉，同一个来源里的重复记录就丢失了。",
      "commonErrors": [
        {
          "sql": "SELECT customer_id,'old' AS source FROM old_customers UNION SELECT customer_id,'new' AS source FROM new_customers ORDER BY customer_id,source",
          "reason": "来源列不阻止同一个来源内的重复记录被UNION去除。",
          "validation": "典型错误已在至少一组夹具被结果/状态比对拒绝"
        }
      ],
